<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks fell, six rose and seven were flat in 22.3-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,637.0 points, 0.3 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 1.3 percent to 154 zlotys in a 11.7-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
